      "problemId": "lec-10-q1b",
      "steps": [
        "$\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{\\sin t}{1-\\cos t}$。",
        "對 $t$ 微分（除法法則）：分子是 $\\cos t(1-\\cos t)-\\sin t\\cdot\\sin t=\\cos t-(\\cos^2 t+\\sin^2 t)=\\cos t-1$。所以 $\\frac{d}{dt}\\left(\\frac{dy}{dx}\\right)=\\frac{\\cos t-1}{(1-\\cos t)^2}=-\\frac{1}{1-\\cos t}$。",
        "除以 $\\frac{dx}{dt}=1-\\cos t$：$\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2}=-\\frac{1}{(1-\\cos t)^2}$。",
        "$0<t<2\\pi$ 時 $1-\\cos t>0$，平方後仍是正的，前面有負號，所以 $\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2}<0$：整個拱都凹向下。$t=\\frac{\\pi}{2}$ 時是 $-1$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2}=-\\frac{1}{(1-\\cos t)^2}$，處處小於 0，凹向下。",
      "claim": "D(sin(t)/(1-cos(t)))/(1-cos(t)) == -1/(1-cos(t))^2 ;; D(sin(t)/(1-cos(t)), pi/2)/D(t-sin(t), pi/2) == -1"
    },
    {
      "title": "$x$ 是對數",
      "prompt": "$x=\\ln t$、$y=t^2-1$，求 $t=1$ 處的 $\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2}$。",
      "problemId": "db-par-008",
      "steps": [
        "$\\frac{dx}{dt}=\\frac{1}{t}$，$\\frac{dy}{dt}=2t$，$\\frac{dy}{dx}=2t\\div\\frac{1}{t}=2t^2$。",
        "對 $t$ 微分：$4t$。",
        "除以 $\\frac{dx}{dt}=\\frac{1}{t}$：$4t\\div\\frac{1}{t}=4t^2$。代 $t=1$ 得 4。",
        "檢查：$t=e^x$，$y=e^{2x}-1$，$y''=4e^{2x}$，$x=0$（$t=1$）時是 4。"
      ],
      "answer": "4",
      "claim": "D(2t^2)/D(ln(t)) == 4t^2 ;; D2(e^(2x)-1, 0) == 4"
    }
